<title>INDIA: CRISIL rates India Hero Honda debt issue.</title>
<headline>CRISIL rates India Hero Honda debt issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Credit Rating Information Services of India Ltd (CRISIL) said it assigned a P1+ rating for a 1.6 billion rupee commercial paper programme of two-wheel maker Hero Honda Motors Ltd.</p>
<p>The rating indicated that the degree of safety regarding timely payment on the instrument was strong, CRISIL said.</p>
<p>Hero Honda is a joint venture between the Delhi-based Hero Group and Honda Motor Company of Japan manufacturing motorcycles.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
